{
  "name": "00 🌐 Enterprise WhatsApp Master Router & Dispatcher",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "r01-sticky-setup",
      "name": "Router Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 00 🌐 Enterprise WhatsApp Master Router\n**Meta WhatsApp allows only 1 Webhook URL per phone number.**\nहा Master Router सर्व येणारे WhatsApp मेसेजेस एकाच Webhook वर स्वीकारतो आणि योग्य एजंटकडे पाठवतो:\n\n1. **Owner Message:** Owner चा नंबर असल्यास ➔ **50 CEO Agent**\n2. **Employee Request:** रजा, डॉक्युमेंट्स किंवा बिल फोटो असल्यास ➔ **33 Leave Bot / 27 Expense**\n3. **Customer Complaint:** अडचण किंवा तक्रार असल्यास ➔ **12 Complaint Summariser**\n4. **Booking / Appointment:** भेटीची वेळ हवी असल्यास ➔ **08 AI Receptionist**\n5. **New Inquiry / Lead:** सामान्य चौकशी ➔ **51 Gemini AI Lead Bot / 02 Sales Replier**\n\n**Setup:**\n- Meta Developer Portal मध्ये या Workflow चे Webhook URL टाका.\n- Owner चा फोन नंबर टाका.\n- Active करा. सर्व एजंट्स एकमेकांशी जोडले जातील!",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r02-wa-trigger",
      "name": "Meta WhatsApp Inbound Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "messages"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r03-extract-info",
      "name": "Extract Message & Sender",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const msg = $json.messages?.[0];\nif (!msg) return null;\n\nconst contact = $json.contacts?.[0] || {};\nconst senderPhone = msg.from || '';\nconst senderName = contact.profile?.name || 'User';\nconst text = msg.text?.body || (msg.type === 'image' ? '[IMAGE_ATTACHMENT]' : '[MEDIA]');\nconst msgType = msg.type || 'text';\n\n// Check if owner\nconst OWNER_PHONE = 'YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP_NUMBER'; // e.g. 919876543210\nconst isOwner = senderPhone === OWNER_PHONE;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    senderPhone,\n    senderName,\n    text,\n    msgType,\n    isOwner,\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n};"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r04-check-owner",
      "name": "Is Business Owner?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        520,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c_owner",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.isOwner }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r05-dispatch-ceo",
      "name": "Route to 50 CEO Agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        820,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": "YOUR_50_CEO_WORKFLOW_ID",
        "mode": "each",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r06-classify-intent",
      "name": "AI Intent Classifier (Gemini / Claude)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        820,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Classify this WhatsApp message: \"{{ $json.text }}\" from {{ $json.senderName }} ({{ $json.senderPhone }}).\nDetermine which department should handle this:\n1. 'support_booking': wants appointment, meeting, booking slot\n2. 'support_complaint': refund, angry, damaged item, service issue\n3. 'hr_ops': employee asking for leave, payslip, submitting bill\n4. 'sales_inquiry': asking about price, product, service, wanting to buy\n\nReturn JSON ONLY: {\"route\": \"support_booking\" | \"support_complaint\" | \"hr_ops\" | \"sales_inquiry\"}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a lightning-fast router. Classify incoming customer messages into one of the 4 routes accurately. Return valid JSON only."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r07-gemini-model",
      "name": "Gemini 1.5 Flash (Router Brain)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        820,
        340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-1.5-flash",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r08-parse-route",
      "name": "Parse Route Decision",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const raw = $json.output || $json.text || '';\nlet route = 'sales_inquiry';\ntry {\n  const m = raw.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\n  if (m) {\n    const parsed = JSON.parse(m[0]);\n    route = parsed.route || 'sales_inquiry';\n  }\n} catch (e) {}\n\nconst orig = $('Extract Message & Sender').item.json;\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...orig,\n    route\n  }\n};"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r09-switch-department",
      "name": "Department Switch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1360,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "dataType": "string",
        "value1": "={{ $json.route }}",
        "rules": {
          "rules": [
            {
              "value2": "support_booking",
              "output": 0
            },
            {
              "value2": "support_complaint",
              "output": 1
            },
            {
              "value2": "hr_ops",
              "output": 2
            },
            {
              "value2": "sales_inquiry",
              "output": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        "fallbackOutput": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r10-exec-receptionist",
      "name": "Dispatch 08 AI Receptionist",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1660,
